[{"category":"section","location":"#Bijou64.jl","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"Bijou64.jl is a Julia implementation of the bijou64 variable-length integer encoding.\n\nSee the bijou64 specification for details.\n\nFor commentary on the motivations and performance outcomes, read the blog post announcing the encoding.","title":"Bijou64.jl"},{"category":"section","location":"#Installation","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"Bijou64.jl can be installed using Pkg.\n\npkg> add https://github.com/KyleSJohnston/Bijou64.jl","title":"Installation"},{"category":"section","location":"#Example-Usage","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"julia> using Bijou64\n\njulia> Bijou64.encode(UInt64(67_000))\n4-element Vector{UInt8}:\n 0xfa\n 0x00\n 0x03\n 0xc0\n\njulia> Bijou64.decode(UInt64, [0xfa, 0x00, 0x03, 0xc0])\n1-element Vector{UInt64}:\n 0x00000000000105b8","title":"Example Usage"},{"category":"section","location":"#API","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"","title":"API"},{"category":"module","location":"#Bijou64.Bijou64","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"bijou64 variable-length integer encoding\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Bijou64.Bijou64"},{"category":"method","location":"#Bijou64.decode-Union{Tuple{T}, Tuple{Type{T}, Vector{UInt8}}} where T<:Union{UInt16, UInt32, UInt64, UInt8}","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"decode(T, bytes)::Vector{T}\n\nDecode bytes using the bijou64 variable-length integer encoding into a vector of unsigned integers of type T\n\nT may be UInt8, UInt16, UInt32, or UInt64.\n\nA BufferTooShort exception is thrown if bytes is empty or if bytes has too few elements for the tier of the encoded integer.\n\nAn OverflowError is thrown if there is an arithmetic overflow on tier 8 or if a tier of encoded integer is too large for T.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Bijou64.decode"},{"category":"method","location":"#Bijou64.encode-Tuple{T} where T<:Union{UInt16, UInt32, UInt64, UInt8}","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"encode(v)\n\nEncode v using the bijou64 variable-length integer encoding into a Vector{UInt8}\n\nv must be a UInt8, a UInt16, a UInt32, or a UInt64.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Bijou64.encode"},{"category":"method","location":"#Bijou64.encode-Union{Tuple{Vector{T}}, Tuple{T}} where T<:Union{UInt16, UInt32, UInt64, UInt8}","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"encode(values)\n\nEncode values using the bijou64 variable-length integer encoding into a Vector{UInt8}\n\nvalues must be a Vector{T}, where T may be UInt8, UInt16, UInt32, or UInt64.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Bijou64.encode"},{"category":"type","location":"#Bijou64.BufferTooShort","page":"Bijou64.jl","text":"Exception indicating that the byte buffer (vector) is too short\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Bijou64.BufferTooShort"}]
